
### Submit a test service request
POST http://localhost:8080/api/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Broken streetlight",
  "description": "The streetlight near the main road is not working.",
  "category": "Roads and Infrastructure",
  "location": "Nairobi"
}

###

### Test validation - blank title
POST http://localhost:8080/api/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "description": "The streetlight near the main road is not working.",
  "category": "Roads and Infrastructure",
  "location": "Nairobi"
}


### Update request 1 to IN_PROGRESS
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/requests/1/status?status=IN_PROGRESS



### Register a test citizen
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Test Citizen",
  "email": "citizen@example.com",
  "password": "TestPassword123!"
}


### Login with the registered citizen
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "citizen@example.com",
  "password": "TestPassword123!"
}
